        "content": "Tipperary is a mobile app that aggregates anonymized, opt-in tipping data per restaurant, per server shift, and per party size. Users scan a restaurant's QR code (or search by name/location) and instantly see: the average tip percentage, the range of tips given, median party size, and a confidence-adjusted 'suggested tip' for the current shift. No guesswork. No social awkwardness. Just data."
      },
      "3_market_opportunity": {
        "heading": "Market Opportunity",
        "content": {
          "total_addressable_market": "$50B+ in annual U.S. restaurant tips (2024 est.)",
          "serviceable_addressable_market": "$12B across full-service and fast-casual venues with tipping norms",
          "initial_focus": "Top 25 metro areas where tipping culture is strongest and smartphone adoption is highest",
          "growth_driver": "Rise of 'tip fatigue,' digital payment integration, and Gen-Z's demand for transparency in all transactions"
        }
      },
      "4_product_features": {
        "heading": "Core Features",
        "content": [
          "Live per-venue tip dashboard (avg %, median, range, trend over 90 days)",
          "Smart suggested tip based on party size, bill total, service rating, and time-of-day",
          "Server-verified bonus tips: staff can 'claim' a tip to confirm it was appropriate",
          "Group-split calculator with per-person tip allocation",
          "Regional & cuisine-type benchmarks (e.g., 'sushi vs. steakhouse norms in Chicago')",
          "Privacy-first: no PII stored; all data is aggregated and anonymized by default",
          "API partnerships with Square, Toast, and Stripe for passive data enrichment"
        ]
      },
      "5_business_model": {
        "heading": "Business Model",
        "content": {
          "tier_1": "Free for diners (ad-supported at launch)",
          "tier_2": "Restaurant Insights Dashboard – $29/mo per location (tips trends, peak-hour tipping analytics, staff performance context)",
          "tier_3": "Enterprise POS Integration – $99/mo per location (real-time API, white-label widgets)",
          "tier_4": "Future: Tipperary Insurance – small premium offering tipping-rate guarantees for hospitality employers",
          "unit_economics_note": "CAC <$4.50 via in-restaurant QR placement; projected LTV $14.80 over 24 months"
        }
      },
      "6_competitive_advantage": {
        "heading": "Why Tipperary Wins",
        "content": "There is no dedicated, data-driven tipping intelligence platform today. Competitors are either generic expense trackers (Splitwise), restaurant review sites (Yelp – no tipping data), or POS analytics (Toast – B2B only, opaque to diners). Tipperary owns the two-sided flywheel: diners generate data → restaurants pay for insights → more restaurants integrate → richer data for diners. The network effect is structural, not superficial."
      },
      "7_go_to_market": {
        "heading": "Go-To-Market Strategy",
        "content": {
          "phase_1_launch": "Pilot in Austin, TX and Portland, OR – 200 partner restaurants with in-table QR codes and staff incentive ($1 per verified tip entry)",
          "phase_2_growth": "Viral loop: 'See how your tip compares' social share cards; partnerships with tipping-adjacent influencers and financial-literacy creators",
          "phase_3_scale": "POS marketplace integrations (Square App Market, Toast Marketplace, Clover) for zero-friction data access",
          "phase_4_expansion": "Expand tipping-norm markets: Canada, Australia, UK (tipping culture), then Japan/Singapore (gratuity-inclusive norms)"
        }
      },
      "8_team": {
        "heading": "Founding Team",
        "content": [
          {
            "role": "CEO",
            "background": "Ex-Uber Payments PM; scaled a 40-person engineering org in fintech"
          },
          {
            "role": "CTO",
            "background": "Formerly built real-time pricing engines at DoorDash; ML/privacy-crypto background"
          },
          {
            "role": "Head of Partnerships",
            "background": "10 years in hospitality tech; deep relationships with multi-unit restaurant groups"
          }
        ]
      },
      "9_traction_and_validation": {
        "heading": "Traction",
        "content": "1,200 beta users across 3 cities in 6 weeks. 74% weekly retention. 38% of beta diners returned to check a tip benchmark within 48 hours of dining. 4 restaurant groups (12 locations total) signed LOIs for the Insights Dashboard. NPS of 62 among early adopters."
      },
      "10_the_ask": {
        "heading": "The Ask",
        "content": "Raising $2.4M pre-seed to fund 18 months of runway. Allocated: 45% engineering (data pipeline, privacy architecture, mobile apps), 25% GTM (restaurant partnerships, QR hardware, city launches), 15% data-science/ML (tip-prediction models, anomaly detection), 15% operations and legal (privacy compliance: GDPR, CCPA, state tipping laws). Milestone at $2.4M: 50K MAU, 800 paying restaurant locations, $180K MRR → Series A ready."
      }
    },
    "closing_statement": "Tipperary doesn't judge how much you tip. We simply make sure you never wonder again. Data is the new etiquette. Let's build it."
  }
